      "parameters": ["ParamAngleX", "ParamAngleY", "ParamAngleZ", "ParamEyeBallX", "ParamEyeBallY", "ParamEyeLOpen", "ParamEyeROpen", "ParamMouthOpenY", "ParamMouthForm"],
      "notes": "眼镜为角色记忆点，必须独立于眼睛和眉毛绑定；转头时镜片反光需做视差偏移。"
